# ⚠️ SCOPE. This exists to keep the prompt-regression fixtures (test/promptreg/fixtures,
# ~10MB of source mp4s) out of the Railway image. They are test inputs only — nothing in
# index.js reads anything under test/.
#
# Cache cost: the Dockerfile does `COPY package*.json ./` → `npm ci` → `COPY . .`. Nothing
# excluded here matches package*.json, so that layer's content is unchanged and the heavy
# apt/python/insightface layers above it keep their cache. Only the final `COPY . .` is
# invalidated, which is the cheapest layer in the file.
#
# ⚠️ node_modules is DELIBERATELY NOT excluded. It is committed to git in this repo (1303
# files) and `COPY . .` runs AFTER `npm ci --omit=dev`, so the committed copy currently
# overwrites part of the installed tree. Excluding it would change what production runs —
# a separate decision that needs its own verification, not a side effect of this file.

test/
.git/
.gitignore
.env
.env.*
*.md
tmp/
*.log
.DS_Store
